        // We cannot read rewardsForA (private), so we express the precondition by requiring that a prior call to getFirstWithdrawalBonus
        // would have succeeded in crediting at most the contract balance. Instead we conservatively require funding > 0 and assert revert==false.
        // More precisely: when c.balance >= 1 and we funded c with 'funding', then withdrawReward must not revert for any recipient.
